        </div>
        <p class="article-footnote">† See companion study: <a href="https://www.wordsofplainness.org/studies/contention-and-the-reach-of-christ/" class="article-companion-link"><em>Contention, Gatekeeping, and the Reach of Christ</em></a>.</p>
    </div>